>>
Rule 1 (input must be at least 1-D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) ≥ 1
>>
Rule 2 (valid k when k is an integer)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : int} |= v_2 ≥ 0 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) ≥ v_2
>>
Rule 3 (valid k when k is a 0-D tensor)
{v_1 : tensor, v_2 : tensor} |= ndim(v_2) = 0 ∧ v_2 ≥ 0 ∧ shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) ≥ v_2
>>
Rule 4 (sorted flag must be boolean)
{v_3 : bool} |= v_3 = true ∨ v_3 = false
>>
Rule 6 (name, if provided, must be a string)
{v_5 : str} |= v_5 = v_5
